msgid ""
"| 层级          | 能力                      | 模块                                   |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Tier 1        | IndexedDB 只读快照        | Email、Notification、Console、Dream 等 |\n"
"| Tier 2-CRUD   | outbox + 乐观 KV          | Diary、Task                            |\n"
"| Tier 2-Hybrid | outbox + localStorage LWW | Pomodoro（active 计时）                |\n"
"| Tier 2-Stream | SAP 流式 flush            | Chat send                              |\n"
